WEBVTT

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:11.710
You're...

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.350
It's been a long time,

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.950
Uriel.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:16.700
Why have you come here?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.700
Because it looks like you're having some difficulty.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.040
So tell me, why are you 
letting Solomon roam free?

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:27.820
That's...

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.540
We've been over this before.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.570
Or have you grown fond of that human again?

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.720
Bullseye, huh?

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:45.850
But don't forget, if Solomon's soul 
falls into Hell's clutches,

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.370
you really will become a fallen angel.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.980
After I was kind enough to 
stop at one wing last time...

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.610
I...

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.780
I don't like it.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.240
You should only be looking to me.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.500
I am the highest, most righteous of all angels.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.510
If you can't do your job, 
I'll handle things my way.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:14.720
What will you—

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:19.220
Neither the demons nor 
the Elector are my enemies.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.600
The only one I have a problem with is Lucifer.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.350
Michael?

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:31.530
Don't let my name pass your lips 
so casually, you one-winged filth.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:36.650
You are no longer an angel before 
the Throne. You are nothing.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.750
Kidding, kidding! I'm just 
here to check up on things!

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.460
Before I consider what actions to take...

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.830
I will be closely observing William Twining, 
the keeper of Solomon's soul...

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.450
Please help me, William!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:39.140
At this rate, I'll flunk again!

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.400
Do I care? Just flunk already.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.320
Don't say that!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.180
I don't want to have to 
repeat the lower fifth year!

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.490
I'll be the oldest person in the class!

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:51.320
Then you'd better get back 
to your desk right now.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.500
How harsh!

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:56.130
Cramming right before the exams 
is a recipe for failure.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.170
You need to put in the work every day.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.320
Only successful people say that!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.250
My point exactly.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.070
Although you might not make 
number one on this exam.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:09.720
What?

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.570
Who is he?

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:15.190
Elliot Eden. He's in the same class as you.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.440
You really don't remember him?

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.970
I know he just returned to school,

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:25.680
but on the last Latin test, 
he was only three points below you.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.660
Was... he, now?

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.830
Are you William Twining?

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:37.920
Don't you recognize your own prefect?

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.840
My apologies, we've never 
actually spoken in person.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.400
Well, what can I do for you?

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.910
I just wanted to give you a message...

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:52.180
I'm aiming for the top score on our next test.

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.120
Don't try to coast through.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.590
It won't be any fun if you 
make excuses after the fact.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:06.410
Was that a declaration of war?

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.880
Hey, Isaac!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:09.990
Y-Yes?!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.630
Go study!

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:14.030
I'm not involved in this!

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:17.700
I won't be satisfied with just the top!
I want you in second place!

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.210
That's impossible!

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:22.760
He'll rue the day he challenged my genius intellect

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.670
even more than he'll rue the day of his death.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:30.770
I see.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.450
So that's what's got him so fired up.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.620
Yeah, he's been going nonstop.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:42.680
No one's ever challenged Twining 
on the academic stage before.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.150
Swallow, you're a real jack-of-all-trades,

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.780
but William's hopelessly inept at sports.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:52.370
And much less attractive than I am.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.910
Be quiet, all of you.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.380
Isaac, how goes the assignment I gave you?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.380
There's no way I can finish it all...

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.950
Whether there's a way or not, do it!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.860
Dear me...

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:08.180
He's usually so overconfident. What changed?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.410
We should probably leave him be for now.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.640
My scholarship's on the line here.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.300
I will not let my flawless 
academic record be sullied!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:27.400
Figured it'd be packed in here...

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.240
Lucky me!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.080
Oh, it's you.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.470
Show some respect, Eden.

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.130
What's so funny?!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:47.800
Sorry, I really didn't think 
you'd take me so seriously!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.680
I apologize for the misunderstanding.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:54.180
Huh?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.890
I just wanted to get your attention.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:06:59.980
Kidding, kidding!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:09.070
Only the truly worthy should 
be in positions of authority.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.280
It's unfair to the subordinates if 
those at the top are incompetent.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.700
Agreed.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.660
I'm not afraid to make sacrifices 
if they help me achieve my goal.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:23.180
Which, in my case, is to protect 
the things most important to me.

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.700
What about you, William?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.500
Me?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.300
What's most important to you?

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.010
Most important...

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:42.770
For example...

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.440
You know the story of Noah's Ark, right?

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:51.850
A certain angel warned Noah 
of the impending flood.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:56.450
If not for that warning, not a 
single human would have survived.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.940
Not one.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.120
Uh... yeah...

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:06.840
Who knows what the Earth would be like 
today if not for that angel's warning?

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:11.390
In other words, if you focus 
on the wrong things,

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:14.010
by the time you realize your mistake, 
it'll be too late to regret it.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.190
Yeah, true enough.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:21.310
This is a crucial time for us.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.060
Let's both do our best!

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.310
Cohen, pass.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.340
Dennis, fail.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.940
Eden...

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.600
Well done. A pass with distinction.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:43.620
Thank you.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:48.260
<i>And my grade, of course, will be even better.</i>

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:52.300
<i>My grade went down!</i>

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.840
<i>Blast!</i>

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:05.040
<i>Damn it, why does this 
aggravate me so much?!</i>

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:08.400
Get lost!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.720
I'm not in the mood!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.810
Who is he?

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.490
What?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.600
He's definitely not a demon,

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:20.160
but there's something off about him.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.080
There's... too much light.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.120
Light?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.200
He's either descended from a saint,

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.500
or somehow directly connected to Heaven.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.250
So what if he is? I couldn't care less!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:06.710
Huh?!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.040
Something wrong, Twining?

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:11.630
N-No, sir, nothing at all!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.220
I-It's not what you think!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.060
This just...

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.400
William Twining!

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.550
You will proceed to the 
discipline room immediately,

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:27.440
where you will be punished for cheating!

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:47.770
What a disaster. The first disgrace 
in the history of the Twining family.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:50.920
I have to clear my name somehow.

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:55.300
Isaac?

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:59.090
But... I'm not supposed to have visitors...

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:01.640
Head Boy?

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.310
Don't worry, I'll figure something out!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.350
You?

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:09.110
I'll use the holy powers of the 
archangel Michael, defender of justice,

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.770
to find proof of your innocence!

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.720
Hang on, William!

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:14.610
Hey, wait up!

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:18.010
Nothing good will come of this...

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.910
So, any idea who was behind it?

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:21.530
Huh?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.180
You didn't really cheat, did you?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.040
You believe me?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:30.050
Your grades are your only claim to fame.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.540
You would never risk soiling that.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.070
Head Boy!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.090
"Only"?

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.110
Talk to me.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.560
R-Right, well...

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:57.340
That was quite a catastrophe. 
I never pegged you for a cheater!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.610
I didn't cheat!

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.450
I can help you.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.080
I know who the culprit is.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.370
You do?

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.330
I'm willing to testify on your behalf, too.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:15.570
I just want one thing in return.

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:16.420
And that is...?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.750
Answer me this.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:22.380
What is the fate you truly wish for?

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.910
W-Well, of course, it's to become 
one of society's elite—

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.470
No!

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:35.260
I'm talking about the immorality and justice
in this world, in their purest forms!

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.940
All right...

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:43.080
Take Pastor Cecil and the Head Boy.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.770
If the two of them were dangling off a cliff,

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.950
what would you do?

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.700
Huh?

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.480
Answer, William.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:55.460
If given the choice between 
God's Kingdom and Hell,

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.120
which would you select?

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:59.290
What's the meaning of this?!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:03.550
No visitors allowed near the discipline room!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:12.470
I apologize, Pastor Cecil.

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:14.350
I'll go back to my room.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:23.320
We will now commence the trial concerning 
this student's misconduct during the exam.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.800
William Twining, please step forward.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.580
Do you admit to your wrongdoing?

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.050
No, sir.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:35.330
The notes were clearly 
written all over his desk...

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:39.130
Funny how he's managed to get 
the top score every time, too...

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.090
Furthermore, Twining.

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:47.840
Whom do you love best: God or the demons?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.300
Answer the question,

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:53.270
bearer of Solomon's soul.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.680
Isaac?!

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:06.190
Where are we?!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.160
Isaac, what have you done?!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:16.320
I just asked the archangel Michael 
for the power to defend you!

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:20.710
And I thought I'd finally get 
a straight answer out of you.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.730
Too bad.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.770
Eden? Why are you...

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.570
Don't tell me you...

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.250
You really need to learn to 
be quicker on the uptake.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.320
What does that mean?

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.360
Great, here's a troublemaker.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.770
I thought so.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:51.200
You're an angel.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:52.990
Angel?

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.160
You are? Really?!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.210
Wait, is that...

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.820
"There stood a man with his 
sword drawn in his hand..."

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.450
Then you're really the leader of the angels,

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:17.180
the "one who is like God," 
the archangel Michael?!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.790
Archangel?

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:22.330
Don't you remember?

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:27.110
I cleaned up after that kingdom you created,

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:28.630
Solomon.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.070
What... are you talking about?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.500
Honestly...

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.980
You humans are so impudent, 
it's unbelievable.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:42.520
You turn your backs on us, even as 
God bestows his blessings upon you.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:48.590
I shall grant thee "ecstasy," William Twining.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.550
Or should I say Solomon, son of David?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.910
Huh?

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.180
Ecstasy?

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:55.550
William!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:59.430
I will deal with you personally.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:01.190
You should be grateful.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:03.560
Stop!

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:09.570
Shall I take you along as well, Sytry?

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.360
Wha—

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.110
You can't...

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.690
I can.

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:20.500
I am, after all, permitted to judge 
all sinners in the name of God.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.670
I annihilate man and demon alike!

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:35.900
Young Master!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.510
Young Master!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.520
A rose barrier, eh?

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:50.690
Now, let's go somewhere more comfortable.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:57.890
Dantalion?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.300
I had some trouble breaking 
through his damn barrier.

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.080
You are...

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:08.040
Lucifer's favorite disciple,

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.010
the Grand Duke Dantalion.

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:16.010
Don't you dare speak Lucifer's name,

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.800
when it was you who cast 
him down, you traitor!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:24.440
I was stronger than Lucifer.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.320
That's all there was to it.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:31.230
The foundations of this world are 
so beautiful in their simplicity,

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:35.610
as will be your destruction here!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.160
Begone!

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.000
What'd he mean, "cast him down"?

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:48.510
His Highness is Michael's older brother.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.800
When Lucifer rebelled against God,

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.520
he fought Michael, lost, 
and was cast down to Hell.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.060
Dantalion!

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.510
I know all about you, Dantalion.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:15.570
About your life as a man, 
before you sold your soul to Lucifer.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:19.020
And may I just say,

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:21.740
you were the cruelest, coldest, most brutal—

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:22.990
Shut up!

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:35.840
Dantalion!

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.050
Th-This can't be...

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.800
We're evenly matched?!

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:48.520
You don't even deserve to go to purgatory.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.030
Kevin...

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.510
You...

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:02.920
As a pastor of the Church of England,

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:06.500
I will not allow a demon to 
harm one of our students.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:10.000
Stand down. I have no desire to fight you.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:13.980
Dantalion, sto—

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.260
Do you want to die?

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:21.190
Or would you rather reveal
your true identity right here?

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.780
If anything happens to him, 
Heaven will respond with all its might.

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:31.010
Do you want to put the Young 
Master in even more danger?

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:36.890
Do you?

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:41.240
Are you any different?

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:49.870
Ridiculous.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.290
I'm sick of this.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:55.290
Until next time.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:00.070
Well, Twining?

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.200
Nothing to say for yourself?

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.680
Not at all.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:14.440
I, William Twining, hereby plead not guilty.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:19.410
I do so because I take great 
pride in my own intelligence.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:24.320
Those with great wisdom are 
not intimidated by adversity.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:29.790
In short, no test of any nature 
has ever presented a threat to me!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.480
But there is no denying there 
were notes written on your desk.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.690
You claim that someone else 
wrote them, is that it?

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:38.400
I can answer that.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.190
These two confessed.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.260
They admit to writing those 
notes for their own tests.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:48.310
But we only wrote on our own desks, so how...

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:55.730
I aced the makeup test by an 
even bigger margin than usual.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.020
My future is bright with promise again.

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.030
What did you say?!

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:07.170
You heard me. The possibility has arisen

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:09.660
that His Highness may not 
wake from his slumber.

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.160
No...

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.880
We demons are not indestructible.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:17.710
His Highness may be on the verge of vanishing.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.660
Vanishing...

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.050
The Elector...

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:27.340
Solomon's existence grows 
more vital by the moment.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.980
Bring William to Hell?

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:32.100
Why?

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:35.810
Heaven is trying to force 
"ecstasy" upon William.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:39.390
His human personality will vanish,

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:42.190
and he'll simply turn into 
another of Heaven's pawns.

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:46.730
How many men have had
their lives fall into chaos

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.940
because they believed they heard 
the voice of God speaking to them?

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:01.460
We will protect William here in Hell.

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:07.010
They're all nuisances...

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:09.480
Demons and humans alike.

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:42.080
Greetings, everyone.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.520
My name is Mycroft Swallow.

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:45.300
I'm one of the prefects.

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:47.740
Life at our academy is so calm and peaceful

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:49.950
that I actually wish something would happen.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:51.650
I am Baphomet.

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:55.330
If you can't sleep, 
I'll prepare you some warm milk.
